  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Core Problem**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the core problem: what\'s the fundamental user need this app must address? Understanding this is key before diving into features. I\'m focusing on the user\'s pain points and what they are looking to gain from a sleep app. Next, I\'ll identify the existing solutions and how this sleep app will surpass them!\n\n\n**Expanding the Scope**\n\nI\'m now thinking about going way beyond simple monitoring. My focus is now on delivering proactive, science-backed interventions to improve long-term health. I\'m imagining advanced monitoring, sleep stage analysis, environmental correlations, and bio-marker correlations tied to longevity predictions. The differentiator will be a biological age and sleep longevity estimator, linking sleep data to health outcomes.\n\n\n**Developing Intervention Strategies**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into personalized interventions. I\'m focusing on dynamic evening routines, circadian rhythm adjustments, and a CBT-I clinic with interactive tools. I\'m also planning an audio-neuromodulation generator with real-time web audio synthesis for guided NSDR and breathing exercises. The aim is to provide science-backed solutions to improve sleep, with AI integration.\n\n\n**Designing the AI Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating an AI-powered sleep doctor and coach that analyzes sleep data to diagnose problems and generates personalized interventions. Also I\'m planning to include a comprehensive Swift/SwiftUI code studio and exporter to give users a native architecture studio within the app, and also deliver the experience via a PWA. The user wants Swift code and a PWA.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 612245204
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
