  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Elegant Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Elegant Dark\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#050505] text-[#F9FAFB] flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden p-8\'> <header class=\'flex justify-between items-center mb-10\'> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3\'> <div class=\'w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#6366F1] to-[#2DD4BF] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(45,212,191,0.3)]\'> <div class=\'w-5 h-5 bg-[#050505] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\'> <div class=\'w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full\'></div> </div> </div> <span class=\'text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\'>AETHER <span class=\'font-light text-[#94A3B8]\'>SLEEP</span></span> </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-8\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-end\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#64748B]\'>Sleep Efficiency</span> <span class=\'text-xl font-mono text-[#2DD4BF]\'>92.4%</span> </div> <div class=\'w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#1E293B] border border-[#334155] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\'> <div class=\'w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#94A3B8] to-[#475569]\'></div> </div> </div> </header> <main class=\'flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 gap-8\'> <section class=\'col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center relative\'> <div class=\'absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\'> <div class=\'w-[480px] h-[480px] rounded-full border border-[#1E293B] opacity-40\'></div> <div class=\'w-[380px] h-[380px] rounded-full border border-[#334155] opacity-60\'></div> <div class=\'w-[280px] h-[280px] rounded-full border-2 border-[#6366F1] opacity-20\'></div> </div> <div class=\'relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center\'> <div class=\'text-[180px] leading-none font-extralight tracking-tighter text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-[#1E293B]\'> 07<span class=\'text-4xl align-top mt-12 inline-block font-medium\'>H</span>24 </div> <div class=\'mt-[-20px] text-[#2DD4BF] font-mono tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sm\'>Optimal Rest Duration</div> <div class=\'mt-8 flex gap-12\'> <div class=\'text-center\'> <div class=\'text-[#94A3B8] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\'>Deep Sleep</div> <div class=\'text-2xl font-light\'>2h 14m</div> </div> <div class=\'text-center border-x border-[#1E293B] px-12\'> <div class=\'text-[#94A3B8] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\'>REM Phase</div> <div class=\'text-2xl font-light\'>1h 48m</div> </div> <div class=\'text-center\'> <div class=\'text-[#94A3B8] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\'>HRV (Avg)</div> <div class=\'text-2xl font-light text-[#818CF8]\'>64 ms</div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\'col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6 justify-center\'> <div class=\'bg-[#0F172A] border border-[#1E293B] rounded-[32px] p-6 shadow-2xl\'> <div class=\'flex items-center justify-between mb-4\'> <span class=\'text-sm font-medium text-[#F1F5F9]\'>Longevity Prognosis</span> <span class=\'px-3 py-1 bg-[#2DD4BF22] text-[#2DD4BF] text-[10px] uppercase font-bold rounded-full border border-[#2DD4BF44]\'>Predictive</span> </div> <div class=\'flex gap-4 items-end h-24 mb-4\'> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#1E293B] rounded-t-lg h-[40%]\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#1E293B] rounded-t-lg h-[65%]\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#6366F1] rounded-t-lg h-[85%] shadow-[0_-5px_15px_rgba(99,102,241,0.4)]\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#2DD4BF] rounded-t-lg h-[95%] shadow-[0_-5px_15px_rgba(45,212,191,0.4)]\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#1E293B] rounded-t-lg h-[70%]\'></div> </div> <p class=\'text-[#94A3B8] text-xs leading-relaxed\'> Current patterns suggest a <span class=\'text-white\'>12% increase</span> in cardiovascular recovery efficiency over the next 3 months if circadian consistency is maintained. </p> </div> <div class=\'bg-[#1E1B4B] border border-[#312E81] rounded-[32px] p-6 relative overflow-hidden\'> <div class=\'absolute top-0 right-0 p-4\'> <svg width=\'40\' height=\'40\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'#818CF8\' stroke-width=\'1.5\'> <path d=\'M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364-6.364l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707m12.728 0l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707\' stroke-linecap=\'round\'/> </svg> </div> <div class=\'relative z-10\'> <h3 class=\'text-[#C7D2FE] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 font-bold\'>Nightly Protocol</h3> <p class=\'text-xl font-light text-white mb-4 leading-snug\'>Reduce blue light by 20:45. <br/>Lower core temp to 18.5\302\260C.</p> <button class=\'bg-[#818CF8] text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-[#6366F1] transition-colors\'> Begin Wind-down </button> </div> </div> </section> </main> <nav class=\'h-16 flex justify-around items-center border-t border-[#1E293B] mt-8\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-100\'> <div class=\'w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#2DD4BF] rounded-full mb-1 shadow-[0_0_10px_#2DD4BF]\'></div> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter font-bold text-white\'>Discover</span> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-40 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity cursor-pointer\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter font-bold\'>Trends</span> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-40 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity cursor-pointer\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter font-bold\'>Health</span> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-40 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity cursor-pointer\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter font-bold\'>Coach</span> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-40 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity cursor-pointer\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter font-bold\'>Settings</span> </div> </nav> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Elegant Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Elegant Dark\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#050505] text-[#F9FAFB] flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden p-8\'> <header class=\'flex justify-between items-center mb-10\'> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3\'> <div class=\'w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#6366F1] to-[#2DD4BF] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(45,212,191,0.3)]\'> <div class=\'w-5 h-5 bg-[#050505] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\'> <div class=\'w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full\'></div> </div> </div> <span class=\'text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\'>AETHER <span class=\'font-light text-[#94A3B8]\'>SLEEP</span></span> </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-8\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-end\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#64748B]\'>Sleep Efficiency</span> <span class=\'text-xl font-mono text-[#2DD4BF]\'>92.4%</span> </div> <div class=\'w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#1E293B] border border-[#334155] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\'> <div class=\'w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#94A3B8] to-[#475569]\'></div> </div> </div> </header> <main class=\'flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 gap-8\'> <section class=\'col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center relative\'> <div class=\'absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\'> <div class=\'w-[480px] h-[480px] rounded-full border border-[#1E293B] opacity-40\'></div> <div class=\'w-[380px] h-[380px] rounded-full border border-[#334155] opacity-60\'></div> <div class=\'w-[280px] h-[280px] rounded-full border-2 border-[#6366F1] opacity-20\'></div> </div> <div class=\'relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center\'> <div class=\'text-[180px] leading-none font-extralight tracking-tighter text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-[#1E293B]\'> 07<span class=\'text-4xl align-top mt-12 inline-block font-medium\'>H</span>24 </div> <div class=\'mt-[-20px] text-[#2DD4BF] font-mono tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sm\'>Optimal Rest Duration</div> <div class=\'mt-8 flex gap-12\'> <div class=\'text-center\'> <div class=\'text-[#94A3B8] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\'>Deep Sleep</div> <div class=\'text-2xl font-light\'>2h 14m</div> </div> <div class=\'text-center border-x border-[#1E293B] px-12\'> <div class=\'text-[#94A3B8] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\'>REM Phase</div> <div class=\'text-2xl font-light\'>1h 48m</div> </div> <div class=\'text-center\'> <div class=\'text-[#94A3B8] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\'>HRV (Avg)</div> <div class=\'text-2xl font-light text-[#818CF8]\'>64 ms</div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\'col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6 justify-center\'> <div class=\'bg-[#0F172A] border border-[#1E293B] rounded-[32px] p-6 shadow-2xl\'> <div class=\'flex items-center justify-between mb-4\'> <span class=\'text-sm font-medium text-[#F1F5F9]\'>Longevity Prognosis</span> <span class=\'px-3 py-1 bg-[#2DD4BF22] text-[#2DD4BF] text-[10px] uppercase font-bold rounded-full border border-[#2DD4BF44]\'>Predictive</span> </div> <div class=\'flex gap-4 items-end h-24 mb-4\'> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#1E293B] rounded-t-lg h-[40%]\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#1E293B] rounded-t-lg h-[65%]\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#6366F1] rounded-t-lg h-[85%] shadow-[0_-5px_15px_rgba(99,102,241,0.4)]\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#2DD4BF] rounded-t-lg h-[95%] shadow-[0_-5px_15px_rgba(45,212,191,0.4)]\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#1E293B] rounded-t-lg h-[70%]\'></div> </div> <p class=\'text-[#94A3B8] text-xs leading-relaxed\'> Current patterns suggest a <span class=\'text-white\'>12% increase</span> in cardiovascular recovery efficiency over the next 3 months if circadian consistency is maintained. </p> </div> <div class=\'bg-[#1E1B4B] border border-[#312E81] rounded-[32px] p-6 relative overflow-hidden\'> <div class=\'absolute top-0 right-0 p-4\'> <svg width=\'40\' height=\'40\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'#818CF8\' stroke-width=\'1.5\'> <path d=\'M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364-6.364l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707m12.728 0l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707\' stroke-linecap=\'round\'/> </svg> </div> <div class=\'relative z-10\'> <h3 class=\'text-[#C7D2FE] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 font-bold\'>Nightly Protocol</h3> <p class=\'text-xl font-light text-white mb-4 leading-snug\'>Reduce blue light by 20:45. <br/>Lower core temp to 18.5\302\260C.</p> <button class=\'bg-[#818CF8] text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-[#6366F1] transition-colors\'> Begin Wind-down </button> </div> </div> </section> </main> <nav class=\'h-16 flex justify-around items-center border-t border-[#1E293B] mt-8\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-100\'> <div class=\'w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#2DD4BF] rounded-full mb-1 shadow-[0_0_10px_#2DD4BF]\'></div> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter font-bold text-white\'>Discover</span> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-40 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity cursor-pointer\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter font-bold\'>Trends</span> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-40 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity cursor-pointer\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter font-bold\'>Health</span> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-40 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity cursor-pointer\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter font-bold\'>Coach</span> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-40 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity cursor-pointer\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter font-bold\'>Settings</span> </div> </nav> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
