    session_summary: "### 1. Outstanding User Requests\n- **Apply \"Elegant Dark\" Design Theme:** The user requested the application of a specific \"Elegant Dark\" theme to the entire application.\n  - **Status:** IMPLEMENTATION (Ongoing)\n  - **Details:** The theme has been successfully applied to the global shell, dashboard, and two major clinical components. The following components still require styling updates to match the theme:\n    - `/src/components/NeuromodulationStudio.tsx`\n    - `/src/components/SwiftCodeStudio.tsx`\n    - `/src/components/AICoachChat.tsx`\n    - `/src/components/LogSleepModal.tsx`\n  - **Constraint:** \"Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed.\"\n\n### 2. User Knowledge\n- **Design System (\"Elegant Dark\"):**\n  - Background: `#050505`\n  - Cards/Borders: `#1E293B`\n  - Primary Accent: `#2DD4BF`\n  - Secondary Accent: `#6366F1`\n  - Text: `#F9FAFB`\n- **Context:** The application is a React-based PWA with native Swift export capabilities.\n- **Constraint:** Strict adherence to preserving existing component structure while applying new styles.\n\n### 3. Work Accomplished\n- **Global Styling:** Updated `/src/index.css` (base body styles, custom scrollbars, fonts).\n- **Shell & Navigation:** Updated `/src/App.tsx` and `/src/components/Header.tsx` to use the new color palette and layout.\n- **Dashboard:** Updated `/src/components/SleepDashboard.tsx` to use the new theme (cards, borders, accent colors).\n- **Longevity & Clinical Components:** Updated `/src/components/LongevityPrognosis.tsx` and `/src/components/InterventionsClinic.tsx` to align with the \"Elegant Dark\" theme, ensuring consistency in background, border, and accent colors while maintaining all interactive functionality (sliders, checkboxes, etc.).\n\n### 4. Model Knowledge\n- **Architecture:** React SPA using Tailwind CSS.\n- **Styling Pattern:** The \"Elegant Dark\" theme uses a specific set of hex codes (`#050505`, `#1E293B`, `#2DD4BF`, etc.) applied consistently to `bg`, `border`, `text`, and `shadow` properties.\n- **Navigation:** Handled via `activeTab` state in `App.tsx`.\n- **Constraint:** Do not alter the underlying HTML structure of components; only modify `className` attributes and layout container styles.\n\n### 5. Files and Code\n- **Edited Files:**\n  - `/src/index.css`: Added base styles and font configuration.\n  - `/src/App.tsx`: Applied theme to the main layout and persistent audio player.\n  - `/src/components/Header.tsx`: Applied theme to navigation and brand elements.\n  - `/src/components/SleepDashboard.tsx`: Applied theme to all cards, gauges, and diagnostic report sections.\n  - `/src/components/LongevityPrognosis.tsx`: Applied theme to the longevity simulation interface.\n  - `/src/components/InterventionsClinic.tsx`: Applied theme to the CBT-I and evening routine interface.\n- **Viewed Files:**\n  - `/src/components/LongevityPrognosis.tsx`: Investigated for styling updates.\n  - `/src/components/InterventionsClinic.tsx`: Investigated for styling updates.\n\n### 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n- **Current Work:** Systematically applying the \"Elegant Dark\" theme to the remaining component suite.\n- **Next Steps:**\n  1.  Apply the \"Elegant Dark\" theme to the remaining components:\n      - `/src/components/NeuromodulationStudio.tsx`\n      - `/src/components/SwiftCodeStudio.tsx`\n      - `/src/components/AICoachChat.tsx`\n      - `/src/components/LogSleepModal.tsx`\n  2.  Verify that all components maintain their original functionality and structure while adopting the new visual style."
