    session_summary: "# 1. Outstanding User Requests\n- **Apply \"Elegant Dark\" Design Theme:**\n  - **Status:** COMPLETED.\n  - **Details:** The user requested the application of the \"Elegant Dark\" design theme to the entire application, with the constraint to preserve existing HTML structure and functionality. All components have been updated.\n\n# 2. User Knowledge\n- **Design System (\"Elegant Dark\"):**\n  - Background: `#050505`\n  - Cards/Borders: `#1E293B`\n  - Primary Accent: `#2DD4BF`\n  - Secondary Accent: `#6366F1`\n  - Text: `#F9FAFB`\n- **Context:** The application is a React-based PWA with native Swift export capabilities.\n- **Constraint:** Strict adherence to preserving existing component structure while applying new styles. Do NOT replace or restructure existing HTML elements.\n\n# 3. Work Accomplished\n- **Global Styling:** Updated `/src/index.css` (base body styles, custom scrollbars, fonts).\n- **Shell & Navigation:** Updated `/src/App.tsx` and `/src/components/Header.tsx` to use the new color palette and layout.\n- **Dashboard:** Updated `/src/components/SleepDashboard.tsx` to use the new theme.\n- **Longevity & Clinical Components:** Updated `/src/components/LongevityPrognosis.tsx` and `/src/components/InterventionsClinic.tsx`.\n- **Neuromodulation & Tools:** Updated `/src/components/NeuromodulationStudio.tsx`, `/src/components/SwiftCodeStudio.tsx`, `/src/components/AICoachChat.tsx`, and `/src/components/LogSleepModal.tsx` to align with the \"Elegant Dark\" theme.\n- **Summary:** The entire application suite has been successfully migrated to the \"Elegant Dark\" design theme while maintaining full functional integrity.\n\n# 4. Model Knowledge\n- **Architecture:** React SPA using Tailwind CSS.\n- **Styling Pattern:** The \"Elegant Dark\" theme uses a specific set of hex codes (`#050505`, `#1E293B`, `#2DD4BF`, etc.) applied consistently to `bg`, `border`, `text`, and `shadow` properties.\n- **Navigation:** Handled via `activeTab` state in `App.tsx`.\n- **Constraint:** Do not alter the underlying HTML structure of components; only modify `className` attributes and layout container styles.\n\n# 5. Files and Code\n- **Edited Files:**\n  - `/src/components/NeuromodulationStudio.tsx`: Applied theme styling to the synthesizer and breath pacer interface.\n  - `/src/components/SwiftCodeStudio.tsx`: Applied theme styling to the Swift code viewer and explorer.\n  - `/src/components/AICoachChat.tsx`: Applied theme styling to the chat interface, message bubbles, and input form.\n  - `/src/components/LogSleepModal.tsx`: Applied theme styling to the modal container, inputs, and buttons.\n- **Viewed Files:**\n  - `/src/components/NeuromodulationStudio.tsx`: Investigated for styling updates.\n  - `/src/components/SwiftCodeStudio.tsx`: Investigated for styling updates.\n  - `/src/components/AICoachChat.tsx`: Investigated for styling updates.\n  - `/src/components/LogSleepModal.tsx`: Investigated for styling updates.\n\n# 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n- **Status:** The request to apply the \"Elegant Dark\" theme is fully satisfied.\n- **Next Steps:** The application is now fully styled according to the \"Elegant Dark\" theme. The next agent should confirm with the user if they are satisfied with the visual implementation or if they wish to proceed with further feature development (e.g., expanding the sleep app functionality, refining the Swift export logic, or adding new clinical tools)."
