  planner_response {
    response: "The **\"Elegant Dark\"** design theme has been applied across the entire **SomnaLux** application suite while preserving all features, interactive tools, and data visualizations.\n\n### Design & Visual Implementation\n- **Refined Color Palette**: Anchored on a deep `#050505` dark background with `#0F172A` cards, subtle `#1E293B` structural borders, and generous padding for high visual hierarchy.\n- **Biomarker Accents**: `#2DD4BF` (Teal) highlights deep slow-wave metrics, primary CTA controls, and audio synthesizers, paired with `#6366F1` (Indigo) for circadian tracking and vagal breathwork rhythms.\n- **Typography & Readability**: High-contrast `#F9FAFB` headers and `#CBD5E1` body text with `#94A3B8` metadata labels for comfortable nighttime readability.\n- **Component Styling**:\n  - **Acoustic Neuromodulation Studio**: High-contrast synthesizer cards, pulsing breath rings with glowing aura backdrops, and styled frequency sliders.\n  - **Native Swift Studio**: Dark Xcode file explorer, `.swift` syntax container, and clean export buttons.\n  - **Dr. Somna AI Consultation**: Distinct user and doctor chat bubbles, quick clinical prompt pills, and glowing response indicators.\n  - **Custom Sleep Record Modal**: Sleek dark dialog with form inputs and primary action buttons."
