  planner_response {
    response: "I have upgraded and refined **SomnaLux**, bringing the scientific core to the forefront of the user experience and ensuring immediate visual responsiveness across all interactive controls.\n\n### \360\237\224\254 Core Scientific Foundations & Discoverability\n- **Surfaced Scientific Mechanisms Engine**: Introduced a dedicated **\"Science & Mechanisms\"** clinical explorer directly in the primary navigation, detailing the 4 biological pillars of sleep:\n  1. **Glymphatic Brain Detoxification**: Interactive hydrodynamics simulation (*Science* / *Nature*) modeling Aquaporin-4 (AQP4) water channel dilation, 60% interstitial space expansion, and CSF-ISF Tau/Beta-Amyloid clearance during Slow-Wave Sleep (SWS).\n  2. **Autonomic Vagal Recovery & Dipping**: Parasympathetic vagus nerve brake simulator detailing nocturnal RMSSD variance, acetylcholine sinoatrial deceleration, and 10\342\200\22320% arterial blood pressure dipping.\n  3. **Circadian Suprachiasmatic Nucleus (SCN) Pacemaker**: 24-hour interactive biorhythm scrubber linking the two-process model (Process S Adenosine buildup vs Process C Melatonin onset) with core body temperature nadir.\n  4. **Endocrine & Metabolic Homeostasis**: Deep delta-wave pulsatile Human Growth Hormone (HGH) secretion, GLUT4 insulin resensitization, and Natural Killer (NK) immune cytotoxicity.\n\n### \342\232\241 Interactive UI & Real-Time Feedback\n- **1-Click Clinical Scenario Switcher**: Positioned a responsive archetype switcher at the top of the dashboard to instantly toggle between clinical scenarios (*Baseline Modern*, *High-Stress Sympathetic Overdrive*, *Chronic Insomnia & WASO*, *Delayed Circadian Phase*, and *Elite Longevity Protocol*).\n- **Live \"What-If\" Biomarker Modeler**: Embedded interactive sliders directly within the telemetry view to calculate real-time impacts on **Biological Sleep Age**, **Cardiovascular Hazard Ratio**, and **Restorative Quality**.\n- **Interactive Hypnogram Epoch Inspector**: Implemented epoch-level selection on the sleep architecture graph, displaying precise EEG frequency bands (Delta 0.5\342\200\2234 Hz, Sleep Spindles 12\342\200\22314 Hz, Theta, Beta), stage duration, and autonomic heart rate metrics.\n- **Audio Oscilloscope in Neuromodulation Studio**: Added a live HTML5 Canvas waveform oscilloscope that animates synthesized carrier frequencies, binaural delta interference patterns, and real-time gain adjustments.\n- **1-Click Modal Presets**: Enhanced the custom sleep logger with one-tap scenario pre-fills (*Elite Recovery*, *High Stress*, *Insomnia / WASO*) for instant testing."
    modified_response: "I have upgraded and refined **SomnaLux**, bringing the scientific core to the forefront of the user experience and ensuring immediate visual responsiveness across all interactive controls.\n\n### \360\237\224\254 Core Scientific Foundations & Discoverability\n- **Surfaced Scientific Mechanisms Engine**: Introduced a dedicated **\"Science & Mechanisms\"** clinical explorer directly in the primary navigation, detailing the 4 biological pillars of sleep:\n  1. **Glymphatic Brain Detoxification**: Interactive hydrodynamics simulation (*Science* / *Nature*) modeling Aquaporin-4 (AQP4) water channel dilation, 60% interstitial space expansion, and CSF-ISF Tau/Beta-Amyloid clearance during Slow-Wave Sleep (SWS).\n  2. **Autonomic Vagal Recovery & Dipping**: Parasympathetic vagus nerve brake simulator detailing nocturnal RMSSD variance, acetylcholine sinoatrial deceleration, and 10\342\200\22320% arterial blood pressure dipping.\n  3. **Circadian Suprachiasmatic Nucleus (SCN) Pacemaker**: 24-hour interactive biorhythm scrubber linking the two-process model (Process S Adenosine buildup vs Process C Melatonin onset) with core body temperature nadir.\n  4. **Endocrine & Metabolic Homeostasis**: Deep delta-wave pulsatile Human Growth Hormone (HGH) secretion, GLUT4 insulin resensitization, and Natural Killer (NK) immune cytotoxicity.\n\n### \342\232\241 Interactive UI & Real-Time Feedback\n- **1-Click Clinical Scenario Switcher**: Positioned a responsive archetype switcher at the top of the dashboard to instantly toggle between clinical scenarios (*Baseline Modern*, *High-Stress Sympathetic Overdrive*, *Chronic Insomnia & WASO*, *Delayed Circadian Phase*, and *Elite Longevity Protocol*).\n- **Live \"What-If\" Biomarker Modeler**: Embedded interactive sliders directly within the telemetry view to calculate real-time impacts on **Biological Sleep Age**, **Cardiovascular Hazard Ratio**, and **Restorative Quality**.\n- **Interactive Hypnogram Epoch Inspector**