  planner_response {
    response: "**SomnaLux** is designed as a full-cycle clinical sleep medicine and cellular longevity platform. It takes raw biometric telemetry (either logged manually, simulated through clinical archetypes, or streamed from Apple HealthKit) and translates it into three actionable layers: **Diagnostics**, **Long-Term Prognosis**, and **Real-Time Therapeutics**.\n\nHere is an overview of how the app works across its core modules:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Polysomnographic Diagnostics & Telemetry\n- **Restorative Sleep Score & Architecture**: Combines your Slow-Wave Sleep (SWS), REM density, sleep efficiency, and nocturnal HRV to compute a composite restorative index (0\342\200\223100).\n- **Interactive Hypnogram**: Displays your sleep stages across time. Clicking any epoch unlocks EEG frequency band details (Delta 0.5\342\200\2234 Hz, Sleep Spindles 12\342\200\22314 Hz, Theta, and Beta) and real-time heart rate.\n- **Live \"What-If\" Biomarker Modeler**: Use the interactive sliders on the dashboard to simulate what happens to your biological age and recovery score if you gain +30 minutes of deep sleep or +15ms of HRV.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Biological Cellular Mechanisms\nUnder the **Science & Mechanisms** tab, you can explore and interact with the four pillars of sleep science:\n- **Glymphatic Detoxification**: Toggle between *Wakefulness* and *Deep Sleep* to see how astrocytes shrink by 60% during Slow-Wave Sleep, allowing cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) to flush out Beta-Amyloid and Tau proteins (*Science* 2013).\n- **Autonomic Vagal Recovery**: Slide the vagal brake control to observe how parasympathetic activation increases beat-to-beat HRV (RMSSD) and restores the critical 10\342\200\22320% nocturnal blood pressure dipping.\n- **Circadian SCN Pacemaker**: Scrub through the 24-hour solar oscillator to see the interplay between **Process S** (Adenosine sleep pressure) and **Process C** (Melatonin onset / core temperature nadir).\n- **Endocrine & Metabolic Homeostasis**: Explores the 95% pulsatile Human Growth Hormone (HGH) release during delta bursts and GLUT4 cellular insulin resensitization.\n\n---\n\n### 3. 10-Year Health Impact & Longevity Engine\n- **Biological Sleep Age**: Calculates the divergence between your chronological age and cellular biological age based on your cumulative sleep architecture and sleep debt.\n- **Cardiovascular & Neurocognitive Hazard Ratios**: Quantifies long-term clinical risks (arterial stiffness, metabolic insulin resistance, cognitive decline) and projects how targeted sleep interventions reverse those risk curves over a 10-year horizon.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Digital Therapeutics & CBT-I Clinic\n- **Sleep Restriction & Stimulus Control**: Calculates prescribed time-in-bed windows to rapidly extinguish conditioned arousal and boost sleep efficiency above 85\342\200\22390%.\n- **Metabolic Caffeine Half-Life Tracker**: Live decay curve showing remaining adenosine-receptor blockade based on your last cup of coffee.\n- **Evening Wind-Down Checklist**: Step-by-step biological anchoring (lux reduction, thermal vasodilation, peripheral cooling).\n\n---\n\n### 5. Acoustic Neuromodulation & Vagal Breath Pacer\n- **Real-Time Soundscape Synthesizer**: Uses the browser\342\200\231s Web Audio API to generate pure harmonic waveforms with zero latency\342\200\224including **2.5 Hz Delta binaural beats** for deep sleep induction, **6.0 Hz Theta**, Pink Noise, and Brown Noise.\n- **Live Frequency Oscilloscope**: Visualizes audio waveforms in real time.\n- **Guided Breath Pacer**: Visual and acoustic pacing for **4-7-8 Vagal Breathing**, **Box Breathing (4x4)**, and **Physiological Sighs** to trigger acetylcholine release and lower pre-sleep heart rate.\n- **Non-Sleep Deep Rest (NSDR)**: Built-in 10-minute restorative timer for afternoon energy replenishment.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Native Swift (iOS) Architecture\n- Under the **Native Swift (iOS)** tab, developers can inspect and copy complete, modular SwiftUI & HealthKit code (`HealthKitSleepManager.swift`, `SleepPrognosisEngine.swift`, `NeuromodulationAudioEngine.swift`) ready to compile into a native iOS application.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\232\200 How to Try It Immediately\n1. **Try Clinical Scenarios**: Click any scenario button in the top bar (*High-Stress*, *Chronic Insomnia*, *Elite Longevity*) to see the entire dashboard and prognosis recalculate in real time.\n2. **Test the Audio Synthesizer**: Go to **Acoustic Synthesizer**, select *2.5 Hz Delta Beats*, and click **Play Soundscape** to hear real-time binaural tone generation.\n3. **Log a Custom Night**: Click **+ Log Night** in the top-right header to input custom hours, HRV, and sleep stages."
    thinking: "**Clarifying the Approach**\n\nI\'m focusing on the user\'s informational query about the app\'s functionality. My current approach involves crafting a clear and concise explanation to address their \"how does it work\" question directly. I\'m aiming for a response that offers accessible information.\n\n\n**Refining the Explanation**\n\nI\'m structuring the response to mirror the user\'s focus on functionality. I\'ve decided to keep explanations very simple and accessible, avoiding jargon, and directly addressing their question about how the app works. My plan is to first define the core purpose. Next I will explain the six main modules, beginning with the diagnostics dashboard, detailing sleep metrics, and the restorative score. I\'ll also describe the interactive hypnogram and biomarker modeler. I\'ll follow up with the science mechanisms, detailing all 4 biological pillars.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "**SomnaLux** is designed as a full-cycle clinical sleep medicine and cellular longevity platform. It takes raw biometric telemetry (either logged manually, simulated through clinical archetypes, or streamed from Apple HealthKit) and translates it into three actionable layers: **Diagnostics**, **Long-Term Prognosis**, and **Real-Time Therapeutics**.\n\nHere is an overview of how the app works across its core modules:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Polysomnographic Diagnostics & Telemetry\n- **Restorative Sleep Score & Architecture**: Combines your Slow-Wave Sleep (SWS), REM density, sleep efficiency, and nocturnal HRV to compute a composite restorative index (0\342\200\223100).\n- **Interactive Hypnogram**: Displays your sleep stages across time. Clicking any epoch unlocks EEG frequency band details (Delta 0.5\342\200\2234 Hz, Sleep Spindles 12\342\200\22314 Hz, Theta, and Beta) and real-time heart rate.\n- **Live \"What-If\" Biomarker Modeler**: Use the interactive sliders on the dashboard to simulate what happens to your biological age and recovery score if you gain +30 minutes of deep sleep or +15ms of HRV.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Biological Cellular Mechanisms\nUnder the **Science & Mechanisms** tab, you can explore and interact with the four pillars of sleep science:\n- **Glymphatic Detoxification**: Toggle between *Wakefulness* and *Deep Sleep* to see how astrocytes shrink by 60% during Slow-Wave Sleep, allowing cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) to flush out Beta-Amyloid and Tau proteins (*Science* 2013).\n- **Autonomic Vagal Recovery**: Slide the vagal brake control to observe how parasympathetic activation increases beat-to-beat HRV (RMSSD) and restores the critical 10\342\200\22320% nocturnal blood pressure dipping.\n- **Circadian SCN Pacemaker**: Scrub through the 24-hour solar oscillator to see the interplay between **Process S** (Adenosine sleep pressure) and **Process C** (Melatonin onset / core temperature nadir).\n- **Endocrine & Metabolic Homeostasis**: Explores the 95% pulsatile Human Growth Hormone (HGH) release during delta bursts and GLUT4 cellular insulin resensitization.\n\n---\n\n### 3. 10-Year Health Impact & Longevity Engine\n- **Biological Sleep Age**: Calculates the divergence between your chronological age and cellular biological age based on your cumulative sleep architecture and sleep debt.\n- **Cardiovascular & Neurocognitive Hazard Ratios**: Quantifies long-term clinical risks (arterial stiffness, metabolic insulin resistance, cognitive decline) and projects how targeted sleep interventions reverse those risk curves over a 10-year horizon.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Digital Therapeutics & CBT-I Clinic\n- **Sleep Restriction & Stimulus Control**: Calculates prescribed time-in-bed windows to rapidly extinguish conditioned arousal and boost sleep efficiency above 85\342\200\22390%.\n- **Metabolic Caffeine Half-Life Tracker**: Live decay curve showing remaining adenosine-receptor blockade based on your last cup of coffee.\n- **Evening Wind-Down Checklist**: Step-by-step biological anchoring (lux reduction, thermal vasodilation, peripheral cooling).\n\n---\n\n### 5. Acoustic Neuromodulation & Vagal Breath Pacer\n- **Real-Time Soundscape Synthesizer**: Uses the browser\342\200\231s Web Audio API to generate pure harmonic waveforms with zero latency\342\200\224including **2.5 Hz Delta binaural beats** for deep sleep induction, **6.0 Hz Theta**, Pink Noise, and Brown Noise.\n- **Live Frequency Oscilloscope**: Visualizes audio waveforms in real time.\n- **Guided Breath Pacer**: Visual and acoustic pacing for **4-7-8 Vagal Breathing**, **Box Breathing (4x4)**, and **Physiological Sighs** to trigger acetylcholine release and lower pre-sleep heart rate.\n- **Non-Sleep Deep Rest (NSDR)**: Built-in 10-minute restorative timer for afternoon energy replenishment.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Native Swift (iOS) Architecture\n- Under the **Native Swift (iOS)** tab, developers can inspect and copy complete, modular SwiftUI & HealthKit code (`HealthKitSleepManager.swift`, `SleepPrognosisEngine.swift`, `NeuromodulationAudioEngine.swift`) ready to compile into a native iOS application.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\232\200 How to Try It Immediately\n1. **Try Clinical Scenarios**: Click any scenario button in the top bar (*High-Stress*, *Chronic Insomnia*, *Elite Longevity*) to see the entire dashboard and prognosis recalculate in real time.\n2. **Test the Audio Synthesizer**: Go to **Acoustic Synthesizer**, select *2.5 Hz Delta Beats*, and click **Play Soundscape** to hear real-time binaural tone generation.\n3. **Log a Custom Night**: Click **+ Log Night** in the top-right header to input custom hours, HRV, and sleep stages."
