  planner_response {
    response: "The app is running live and interactive. If the preview window ever appeared static or unresponsive previously, it was due to a stale dev server state during compilation, which is now refreshed.\n\n### How to Navigate & Test All Working Interactive Features:\n\n1. **Top Navigation Tabs**:\n   - **Diagnostics & Telemetry**: Your core polysomnographic dashboard.\n   - **Science & Mechanisms**: Interactive models of **Glymphatic Clearance**, **Vagal Tone Dipping**, and **Circadian SCN Oscillators**.\n   - **Health Impact & Prognosis**: 10-year cardiovascular and cognitive risk trajectories with Biological Sleep Age calculations.\n   - **CBT-I & Interventions**: Sleep restriction window calculator, caffeine half-life metabolic tracker, and evening wind-down checklists.\n   - **Acoustic Synthesizer**: Web Audio pure frequency generator with **2.5 Hz Delta Binaural Beats**, **Theta waves**, **Pink/Brown noise**, live **Oscilloscope**, and **4-7-8 Guided Breath Pacer**.\n   - **Native Swift (iOS)**: Complete SwiftUI & HealthKit code viewer with syntax highlighting and 1-click copy.\n   - **Dr. Somna (AI)**: Sleep neurologist AI consultation interface.\n\n2. **Immediate 1-Click Interactive Triggers (Right on the Main Screen)**:\n   - **Clinical Scenario Switcher**: Click any of the 5 cards at the top (*Baseline*, *High Stress*, *Chronic Insomnia*, *Circadian Lag*, *Elite Longevity*) to instantly recalculate all sleep graphs, efficiency, and longevity metrics.\n   - **Interactive Quick-Launch Banners**: Click **Acoustic Synthesizer**, **Science & Mechanisms**, or **Health & Longevity** directly below the scenario switcher to jump straight to those modules.\n   - **Acoustic Synthesizer (Instant Audio)**: Go to the **Acoustic Synthesizer** tab, click **Play Soundscape (2.5 Hz Delta Beats)**, and you will hear real-time synthesized audio with an animated waveform oscilloscope.\n   - **Live \"What-If\" Biomarker Modeler**: Drag the sliders for **Simulated Extra Deep Sleep** and **Simulated Extra HRV** to watch your Biological Sleep Age and Restorative Score update in real time.\n   - **+ Log Night Button**: Click the top-right button to log custom sleep records or apply 1-click test presets (*Elite Recovery*, *High Stress*, *Insomnia*)."
    modified_response: "The app is running live and interactive. If the preview window ever appeared static or unresponsive previously, it was due to a stale dev server state during compilation, which is now refreshed.\n\n### How to Navigate & Test All Working Interactive Features:\n\n1. **Top Navigation Tabs**:\n   - **Diagnostics & Telemetry**: Your core polysomnographic dashboard.\n   - **Science & Mechanisms**: Interactive models of **Glymphatic Clearance**, **Vagal Tone Dipping**, and **Circadian SCN Oscillators**.\n   - **Health Impact & Prognosis**: 10-year cardiovascular and cognitive risk trajectories with Biological Sleep Age calculations.\n   - **CBT-I & Interventions**: Sleep restriction window calculator, caffeine half-life metabolic tracker, and evening wind-down checklists.\n   - **Acoustic Synthesizer**: Web Audio pure frequency generator with **2.5 Hz Delta Binaural Beats**, **Theta waves**, **Pink/Brown noise**, live **Oscilloscope**, and **4-7-8 Guided Breath Pacer**.\n   - **Native Swift (iOS)**: Complete SwiftUI & HealthKit code viewer with syntax highlighting and 1-click copy.\n   - **Dr. Somna (AI)**: Sleep neurologist AI consultation interface.\n\n2. **Immediate 1-Click Interactive Triggers (Right on the Main Screen)**:\n   - **Clinical Scenario Switcher**: Click any of the 5 cards at the top (*Baseline*, *High Stress*, *Chronic Insomnia*, *Circadian Lag*, *Elite Longevity*) to instantly recalculate all sleep graphs, efficiency, and longevity metrics.\n   - **Interactive Quick-Launch Banners**: Click **Acoustic Synthesizer**, **Science & Mechanisms**, or **Health & Longevity** directly below the scenario switcher to jump straight to those modules.\n   - **Acoustic Synthesizer (Instant Audio)**: Go to the **Acoustic Synthesizer** tab, click **Play Soundscape (2.5 Hz Delta Beats)**, and you will hear real-time synthesized audio with an animated waveform oscilloscope.\n   - **Live \"What-If\" Biomarker Modeler**: Drag the sliders for **Simulated Extra Deep Sleep** and **Simulated Extra HRV** to watch your Biological Sleep Age and Restorative Score update in real time.\n   - **+ Log Night Button**: Click the top-right button to log custom sleep records or apply 1-click test presets (*Elite Recovery*, *High Stress*, *Insomnia*)."
