  planner_response {
    response: "I have checked the application, rebuilt the full production bundle (`dist/`), and restarted the development server.\n\n### \360\237\214\220 Direct Access Options:\nIf the iframe preview in your browser ever gets stuck or cached:\n1. **Open in New Tab**: You can open the live application directly in your browser using the development URL:\n   - **Development URL**: [https://ais-dev-ky2mibt2vxphvdofetzxtu-284658191881.us-east5.run.app](https://ais-dev-ky2mibt2vxphvdofetzxtu-284658191881.us-east5.run.app)\n   - **Shared Preview URL**: [https://ais-pre-ky2mibt2vxphvdofetzxtu-284658191881.us-east5.run.app](https://ais-pre-ky2mibt2vxphvdofetzxtu-284658191881.us-east5.run.app)\n2. **Hard Refresh**: Press `Cmd + Shift + R` (Mac) or `Ctrl + F5` (Windows) to flush any cached assets.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 What Was Verified & Tested:\n- **Zero-Error Full Build**: Successfully compiled both client SPA (`dist/assets/index-*.js`, `dist/assets/index-*.css`) and custom Node backend (`dist/server.cjs`).\n- **Health Check & Routing**: Backend `/api/health` confirmed responding with `200 OK`.\n- **Top Navigation & Interactive Modules**:\n  - **Diagnostics & Telemetry**: Click the clinical scenario chips (*Baseline*, *High Stress*, *Chronic Insomnia*, *Circadian Lag*, *Elite Longevity*) to instantly recalculate the hypnogram and restoration scores.\n  - **Acoustic Synthesizer**: Web Audio binaural frequency generator with pure 2.5 Hz Delta waves, theta tones, pink/brown noise, and a live Canvas oscilloscope.\n  - **Science & Mechanisms**: Interactive models for **Glymphatic Hydrodynamics**, **Vagal Tone**, and **Circadian SCN**.\n  - **Health Impact & Longevity**: 10-year risk trajectories and Biological Sleep Age calculations.\n  - **CBT-I & Interventions**: Sleep restriction window calculator and caffeine half-life decay curve.\n  - **Native Swift (iOS)**: SwiftUI & HealthKit code viewer with one-click copy."
